{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/63","id":3479822101,"node_id":"PR_kwDOOns7hc7Pad8V","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/63","diff_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/63.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/63.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/63","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/63/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/63/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/63/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/statuses/605181a7278c3272d9b7782bc5761453094ac396","number":63,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: add register_drf_filter_tool for django-filter integration","user":{"login":"harryd31","id":6937848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Mzc4NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6937848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31","html_url":"https://github.com/harryd31","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAdds `register_drf_filter_tool` and `drf_publish_filter_mcp_tool` — a new DRF tool registration method that automatically exposes `django-filter` FilterSet parameters as typed, optional MCP tool inputs.\n\nThis is the feature proposed in #62.\n\n### What it does\n\nWhen a DRF `ListModelMixin` ViewSet has a `filterset_class` or `filterset_fields`, `register_drf_filter_tool` reads every declared filter and registers it as a typed tool parameter (bool, float, or str). A `limit` parameter caps the result set. Agents see a fully documented schema — updating a FilterSet automatically updates the tool's interface.\n\n### Example usage\n\n**Imperative:**\n```python\nfrom mcp_server import mcp_server\n\nmcp_server.register_drf_filter_tool(\n    CampaignViewSet,\n    actions={'get': 'list'},\n    instructions=\"Search campaigns by any filter field.\",\n)\n```\n\n**Decorator:**\n```python\nfrom mcp_server import drf_publish_filter_mcp_tool\n\n@drf_publish_filter_mcp_tool(actions={'get': 'list'})\nclass CampaignViewSet(ModelViewSet):\n    filterset_class = CampaignFilter\n    ...\n```\n\n### Design decisions\n\n- **Separate module** (`mcp_server/drf_filter.py`): All `django-filter`-specific logic (helpers, `_DRFFilterCallerTool`, `register_drf_filter_tool`) lives here, keeping the optional dependency boundary clean.\n- **Thin delegates in `djangomcp.py`**: `DjangoMCP.register_drf_filter_tool()` method and `drf_publish_filter_mcp_tool` decorator follow the existing pattern (like `register_drf_list_tool` / `drf_publish_list_mcp_tool`) and delegate to the new module via a lazy import.\n- **`django-filter` is optional**: An `ImportError` with a helpful message is raised only when `register_drf_filter_tool` is actually called without `django-filter` installed. No impact on users who don't use this feature.\n- **Dynamic `inspect.Signature`**: The async wrapper gets a proper signature so that `func_metadata` builds the correct Pydantic `arg_model`, ensuring arguments are validated and forwarded correctly.\n\n### Files changed\n\n| File | Change |\n|---|---|\n| `mcp_server/drf_filter.py` | **New** — 190 lines: helpers, caller class, registration function |\n| `mcp_server/djangomcp.py` | +68 lines: thin method + decorator |\n| `mcp_server/__init__.py` | +1 export: `drf_publish_filter_mcp_tool` |\n\n### Testing\n\n- Existing test suite passes (8/8 in `examples/mcpexample`).\n- Battle-tested in production against 18 DRF ViewSets with complex FilterSets.\n\nCloses #62","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-02T00:34:15Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T00:34:15Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"33a7806eccb27c9c19cad64435bb349b7d617ccf","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"harryd31:feat/drf-filter-tool","ref":"feat/drf-filter-tool","repo":{"id":1198969132,"node_id":"R_kgDOR3bRLA","name":"django-mcp-server","full_name":"harryd31/django-mcp-server","owner":{"login":"harryd31","id":6937848,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5Mzc4NDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6937848?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31","html_url":"https://github.com/harryd31","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/harryd31/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Django MCP Server is 